// Inputs for tools/test_verify_contracts.py: the array and string methods whose result the verifier models by axioms
// (compiler/vc/methods.or, ADR-0053 Addendum A group U8; `xs.pop().unwrap()` through the effect lifting of stmt.or): `sort`, `find`, `findIndex`, `reduce`,
// `s.split(sep)`, `s.indexOf(x)`, `startsWith` / `endsWith` / `includes`, the bytes of short literals. Positive: what the axioms prove. Negative: what they must not prove (UNKNOWN when the
// model is partial, REFUTED where the model is exact). `// expect:` lines are `function kind status`.
// expect: pop_len unwrap VERIFIED
// expect: pop_len ensures VERIFIED
// expect: pop_last unwrap VERIFIED
// expect: pop_last ensures VERIFIED
// expect: pop_prefix unwrap VERIFIED
// expect: pop_prefix ensures VERIFIED
// expect: pop_prefix ensures VERIFIED
// expect: pop_empty unwrap REFUTED
// expect: pop_empty ensures VERIFIED
// expect: pop_wrong unwrap VERIFIED
// expect: pop_wrong ensures REFUTED
// expect: pop_loop loop-invariant VERIFIED
// expect: pop_loop unwrap VERIFIED
// expect: pop_loop loop-invariant VERIFIED
// expect: pop_loop ensures VERIFIED
// expect: sort_len ensures VERIFIED
// expect: sort_members ensures VERIFIED
// expect: sort_first bounds VERIFIED
// expect: sort_first ensures VERIFIED
// expect: sort_sorted_unknown ensures UNKNOWN
// expect: sort_len_wrong ensures UNKNOWN
// expect: find_idx_in_range ensures VERIFIED
// expect: find_idx_match ensures VERIFIED
// expect: find_idx_none ensures VERIFIED
// expect: find_idx_wrong ensures REFUTED
// expect: find_some ensures VERIFIED
// expect: find_member ensures VERIFIED
// expect: find_wrong ensures REFUTED
// expect: reduce_empty ensures VERIFIED
// expect: reduce_unknown ensures UNKNOWN
// expect: split_nonempty bounds VERIFIED
// expect: split_nonempty ensures VERIFIED
// expect: split_first bounds VERIFIED
// expect: split_first bounds VERIFIED
// expect: split_first ensures VERIFIED
// expect: split_two bounds VERIFIED
// expect: split_two ensures VERIFIED
// expect: split_short bounds VERIFIED
// expect: split_short ensures VERIFIED
// expect: split_wrong bounds VERIFIED
// expect: split_wrong ensures UNKNOWN
// expect: split_sep bounds UNKNOWN
// expect: split_sep ensures VERIFIED
// expect: split_sep_ok bounds VERIFIED
// expect: split_sep_ok ensures VERIFIED
// expect: index_of_room ensures VERIFIED
// expect: index_of_empty ensures VERIFIED
// expect: index_of_long ensures VERIFIED
// expect: index_of_wrong ensures UNKNOWN
// expect: sw_same ensures VERIFIED
